* Decision pattern: confirmation is modeled as a separate verification subgoal.
Goal: Delete a selected file
. Goal: Select file
.. Look at <file name>
.. Point to <file name>
.. Click <file name>
. Goal: Request deletion
.. Look at <delete button>
.. Click <delete button>
. Goal: Confirm deletion
.. Read <confirmation message>
.. Verify <file name> should be deleted
.. Look at <confirm delete button>
.. Click <confirm delete button>
.. Verify <file name> is deleted
